o_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_FOR_Courier_Letter2</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_FOR_Courier_Letter2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_FOR_Courier_Letter2\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c6d04a5f-8624-462f-b0a0-52a61687bb58</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c6d04a5f-8624-462f-b0a0-52a61687bb58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c6d04a5f-8624-462f-b0a0-52a61687bb58\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gomwick\" title=\"Gomwick\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Portrait_Gomwick.png/25px-Portrait_Gomwick.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Portrait_Gomwick.png/38px-Portrait_Gomwick.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Portrait_Gomwick.png/50px-Portrait_Gomwick.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gomwick\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Portrait_Gomwick.png/25px-Portrait_Gomwick.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Portrait_Gomwick.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gomwick\" title=\"Gomwick\">Gomwick</a>, who can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Forest\" title=\"Forest\">Forest</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;74&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;479</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Daven,\n</p><p><br>\nIt's a boy! He's healthy and perfect; I've named him after his father. Come back and see us as soon as you can get leave.\n</p><p><br>\nLove,\n</p><p>Flora (and Daven Junior)\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223039\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1618/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24026/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5493/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935566/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.256      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.256      1 -total\n 50.44%   21.314      7 Template:Icon_text\n 44.43%   18.776     17 Template:Trim\n 22.93%    9.688      2 Template:Uid\n 15.59%    6.589      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.22%    5.585      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.25%    5.177      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.02%    4.233      7 Template:Ifempty\n  9.56%    4.039      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!